{"1417590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Legends of Tynedale", "steam_appid": 1417590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Missing that classic Zelda feel?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> delivers intricate dungeons, rewarding exploration, challenging puzzles, and memorable boss battles — a love letter to the era of <i>Link’s Awakening</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.poster.avif?t=1773346329\" width=528 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.webm?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.mp4?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a handcrafted pixel-art world where curiosity is rewarded and every new tool reshapes how you explore. You play as <strong>Geordie</strong>, a young adventurer determined to complete the quest his grandfather never could. What begins as a simple journey soon leads into forgotten ruins, dangerous dungeons, and a dark secret buried deep beneath the land of Tynedale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic top-down action-adventure built around tight progression, deliberate pacing, and thoughtful design — inspired by the golden age of dungeon-driven exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.poster.avif?t=1773346329\" width=570 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.webm?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.mp4?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Handcrafted World</strong><br>Journey through a vibrant pixel-art realm filled with hidden paths, secrets, and optional discoveries. As you gain new abilities, previously unreachable areas gradually open up, encouraging exploration and backtracking in classic fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Puzzle-Focused Dungeons</strong><br>Each dungeon is a carefully designed puzzle box, built around lock-and-key progression, environmental challenges, and clever riddles. Observation and problem-solving are just as important as combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Monsters and Bosses</strong><br>Face a wide variety of enemies and formidable bosses that demand strategy, timing, and mastery of your tools. Every major encounter is designed to feel earned — and memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Weapons, Tools, and Abilities</strong><br>Discover and master new equipment that expands both combat and exploration, opening new routes through the world and new solutions to old problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Lore of Tynedale</strong><br>Piece together the land’s history through environmental storytelling, hidden secrets, and subtle narrative details as you unravel the truth behind your grandfather’s unfinished quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> is a focused, single-player adventure for fans of classic action-adventure games — where discovery matters, dungeons feel meaningful, and progression is always earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.poster.avif?t=1773346329\" width=570 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.webm?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.mp4?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Missing that classic Zelda feel?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> delivers intricate dungeons, rewarding exploration, challenging puzzles, and memorable boss battles — a love letter to the era of <i>Link’s Awakening</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.poster.avif?t=1773346329\" width=528 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.webm?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/0677edc2241855ee074b40fff0437a25.mp4?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a handcrafted pixel-art world where curiosity is rewarded and every new tool reshapes how you explore. You play as <strong>Geordie</strong>, a young adventurer determined to complete the quest his grandfather never could. What begins as a simple journey soon leads into forgotten ruins, dangerous dungeons, and a dark secret buried deep beneath the land of Tynedale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic top-down action-adventure built around tight progression, deliberate pacing, and thoughtful design — inspired by the golden age of dungeon-driven exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.poster.avif?t=1773346329\" width=570 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.webm?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/23ec07963ec5a64c95df563dc52736d5.mp4?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Handcrafted World</strong><br>Journey through a vibrant pixel-art realm filled with hidden paths, secrets, and optional discoveries. As you gain new abilities, previously unreachable areas gradually open up, encouraging exploration and backtracking in classic fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer Puzzle-Focused Dungeons</strong><br>Each dungeon is a carefully designed puzzle box, built around lock-and-key progression, environmental challenges, and clever riddles. Observation and problem-solving are just as important as combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Monsters and Bosses</strong><br>Face a wide variety of enemies and formidable bosses that demand strategy, timing, and mastery of your tools. Every major encounter is designed to feel earned — and memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Weapons, Tools, and Abilities</strong><br>Discover and master new equipment that expands both combat and exploration, opening new routes through the world and new solutions to old problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Lore of Tynedale</strong><br>Piece together the land’s history through environmental storytelling, hidden secrets, and subtle narrative details as you unravel the truth behind your grandfather’s unfinished quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> is a focused, single-player adventure for fans of classic action-adventure games — where discovery matters, dungeons feel meaningful, and progression is always earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.poster.avif?t=1773346329\" width=570 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.webm?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/57bce14fa0f8e6625e9496bcc88d8229.mp4?t=1773346329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Missing that classic Zelda feeling? Step into the handcrafted pixel-art world of The Legends of Tynedale, a classic top-down adventure inspired by the landscapes and castles of Northumberland. Explore puzzle-box dungeons, battle fierce monsters, upgrade your weapons, and uncover hidden secrets.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/header.jpg?t=1773346329", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773346329", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shar